{"officer(axis_minor)" "Finnish field officer—improves spotting and coordination across nearby units; keep out of direct combat."}
{"SissiSP(axis_minor)" "Finnish Sissi special detachment with SMGs, rifles and an LMG team. Suited for reconnaissance, quick strikes and close‑to‑mid‑range fights; vision‑trained elements aid spotting."}
{"white_death(axis_minor)" "Legendary Finnish sniper armed with a scoped Mosin‑Nagant. Exceptional marksmanship and concealment for precision eliminations at long range. Notably high stamina enables frequent repositioning."}
